Short:        Multipass symbolic macro assembler. V2.12
Author:       Matt Dillon
Version:      2.12
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Source:       Fish collection

A multipass, symbolic, macro assembler for multiple target machines,
including 6502, 68705, 6803, and 6811.  Supports conditional assembly,
addressing mode overrides, arbitrary number of named segments, pseudo-ops
for repeat loops, data generation, etc.  
